{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc33 A Cute Ocean-Themed Suika-Style Merge Puzzle Game \ud83d\udc33</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge adorable sea creatures and watch them grow bigger and cuter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine matching friends to evolve them\u2014and aim to create the mighty whale! \ud83d\udc33</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc33 Intense Online Battles with Real PvP Action \ud83d\udc33</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on rivals across the country in thrilling PvP matches!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inherit the heated battle system from the previous title, <i>Whale Game Online</i>, and show off your skills in this new evolution of the series!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s not just about merging\u2014chain combos together to deal massive damage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against players online and climb the competitive ranks!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc33 Gravity &amp; Friendship: Unite for Victory! \ud83d\udc33</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive deep into the ocean floor, where gravity adds a whole new twist to the battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the full 360\u00b0 field to connect combos like never before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But gravity isn\u2019t the only force at play\u2014nearby creatures of the same type will be drawn together by the power of <i>friendship</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the bond as your ocean pals pull each other in!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc33 Solo Play with Competitive Rankings \ud83d\udc33</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy both single-player and multiplayer modes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In solo play, challenge yourself and aim for the top with the ranking system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete for high scores against friends and rivals from all over the country!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4037730?t=1758825052","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037730/c4179b4082ee19e4b52fee644102b9511a3f41ba/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758825052","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037730/99c65df5c9cf31a091d0d1daf3bcb1bb8e03202a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758825052","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037730/99c65df5c9cf31a091d0d1daf3bcb1bb8e03202a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758825052","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc33 A Cute Ocean-Themed Suika-Style Merge Puzzle Game \ud83d\udc33</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge adorable sea creatures and watch them grow bigger and cuter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine matching friends to evolve them\u2014and aim to create the mighty whale! \ud83d\udc33</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc33 Intense Online Battles with Real PvP Action \ud83d\udc33</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on rivals across the country in thrilling PvP matches!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inherit the heated battle system from the previous title, <i>Whale Game Online</i>, and show off your skills in this new evolution of the series!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s not just about merging\u2014chain combos together to deal massive damage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against players online and climb the competitive ranks!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc33 Gravity &amp; Friendship: Unite for Victory! \ud83d\udc33</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive deep into the ocean floor, where gravity adds a whole new twist to the battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the full 360\u00b0 field to 